mes after FOMC on Oct 28th. Tread lightly until then \ud83e\udee1", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 3, "view_count": 525, "id": "pst_6404b32b17fa47faaefbca5d6388cda2", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxLr/trade-plan-for-tuesday", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "created_at": "2026-10-12T23:25:34.003Z", "tag": "Dd", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "", "title": "Only traders will understand. \ud83d\ude02", "body": "", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 1, "reaction_count": 8, "view_count": 619, "id": "pst_bfd3dc578c3b4de981c43d2afeab88ad", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxLo/only-traders-will-understand", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "created_at": "2026-10-12T19:00:55.659Z", "tag": "", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "SPY,QQQ", "title": "How many people have small accounts under $7,500?\n\nHit the \u201c\u2764\ufe0f\u201d I want to help you\n\n$SPY $QQQ", "body": "", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 1, "view_count": 14, "id": "pst_7435e44811044a4dadfdee27dc2544a8", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxKL/how-many-people-have-small-acc", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "created_at": "2026-10-09T18:06:20.076Z", "tag": "Contest", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "", "title": "SPX 7800P @ 1.20 5 cons", "body": "", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 3, "view_count": 243, "id": "pst_d76b76daacb149bdb0173c7b387ac560", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxBM/spx-7800p-120-5-cons", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "created_at": "2026-10-09T14:33:40.088Z", "tag": "Contest", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "", "title": "QQQ has major clouds above so possible bear flag here but fib levels above", "body": "", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, 