nk_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "created_at": "2026-10-07T00:24:34.561Z", "tag": "Dd", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "", "title": "You can become a millionaire just trading this one setup\u2026", "body": "", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 2, "view_count": 45, "id": "pst_bfa3e8a5823e47908fdc3c585a9dba85", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxmD/you-can-become-a-millionaire-j", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "created_at": "2026-10-07T00:19:42.262Z", "tag": "Contest", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "META,AMD,SPX,QQQ,ARM", "title": "TRADE PLAN for Wednesday \ud83d\udcc8", "body": "\n\n$SPX printed a new ATH at 7845 today and closed at 7818. For tomorrow we need to see if SPX can defend 7800 if it fails at this level we can see a consolidation day before the next leg higher to 7900+. $QQQ as long as 748 holds, we'll see a push to 770+ next.\n\nIt's a RISK ON environment as long as $QQQ holds 748. \n\n$AMD to 700 coming this month, $ARM winding up for 330, $META to 800 coming, MU and SNDK are NOT in play YET.. Be patient with these 2 memory stocks... Chip and Mag7 can lead the market in October.\n\nGood luck tmrw everyone! \ud83e\udee1", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 2, "view_count": 345, "id": "pst_eddcb66f470842a9bb615c5555165e35", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxmC/trade-plan-for-wednesday", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "created_at": "2026-10-06T14:00:07.645Z", "tag": "Contest", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "IWM", "title": "$IWM 284C 10/06\n\n @0.39", "body": "", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 2, "view_count": 275, "id": "pst_2650a9a3d75d410e8ba523dd0093bf77", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxjs/dollariwm-284c-1006-039", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "created_at": "2026-10-06T13:46: