es.\n\nThe big market moving event for the month is on the 14th with CPI data then FOMC on the 28th. Try your best to trade around these events if you want to end the month profitable. Don't predict, just react and execute.\n\nGood luck today everyone! \ud83e\udee1", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 4, "view_count": 317, "id": "pst_d8bfdcdcac464236bc5216ec2e457643", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxdi/trade-plan-for-oct-5th", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "created_at": "2026-10-04T23:31:24.046Z", "tag": "Contest", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "QQQ", "title": "$QQQ Trade Idea: October 7 752C", "body": "\nTrigger: 748 \u2705\nTargets: 770, 800 \ud83c\udfaf\n\nQQQ printed a new all time high at 754 on Friday.\n\nIf QQQ can build a base above 748 we should see 770 next.\n\nQQQ to 800+ possible in November.\n\nI\u2019d stay bullish above 748 this week.", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 3, "view_count": 408, "id": "pst_cb82cce8c3aa47ef92855ddc81990890", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxcf/dollarqqq-trade-idea-october-7", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "created_at": "2026-10-04T23:26:18.160Z", "tag": "Contest", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "SPX", "title": "$SPX Trade Ideas", "body": "\nBullish Plan: Oct 7 7800C\nTrigger: 7750 \u2705\nTarget: 7800 \ud83c\udfaf\nStop: 7720 \ud83d\uded1\n\nBearish Plan: Oct 7 7650P\nTrigger: 7700 \u2705\nTargets: 7650, 7620 \ud83c\udfaf\nStop: 7740 \ud83d\uded1\n\nSPX closed at 7722 on Friday.\n\nIf SPX can build a new base above 7700 this week it should test 7816 during October.\n\nSPX through 7816 can run to 8000.\n\nWe still have FOMC, Tech earnings at the end of the month.. so we have the necessary catalysts to see a bigger breakout in the next 4 weeks.\n\nSPX 7620 will be a critical support level during October.\n\nIt needs to defend this level otherwise it can drop another 120 points.\n", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 3, "view_count": 401, "id": "pst_365dfb1b28784320875fa7f93563dad7", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxce/dollarspx-trade-ideas", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "created_at": "2026-10-04T23:21:58.093Z", "tag": "Contest", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "TSLA", "title": "$TSLA Trade Idea: Oct 9 380C", "body": "\nTrigger: 369 \u2705\nTargets: 383, 390 \ud83c\udfaf\nStop: 360 \ud83d\uded1\n\nTSLA moved from 359 to 374 after delivery numbers last Friday.\n\nIf TSLA can hold above 369 early this week it should test 383 next.\n\nTSLA through 383 can run to 400.\n\nTSLA reports earnings on October 28th.\n\nTSLA has been in the same range for 5+ years.\n\nLet\u2019s see if it can move towards 500 during Q4.", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 2, "view_count": 304, "id": "pst_c8f8fdfc001441f5987cae307543a590", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxcd/dollartsla-trade-idea-oct-9-38", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "created_at": "2026-10-04T19:32:12.965Z", "tag": "Dd", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "", "title": "Profitable trading was never about entries or exits\u2026\n\nIt\u2019s about following a proven system, not touching anything else and having the discipline to wait.", "body": "", "embedded_tweet_from": "", "is_hunt_post": false, "comment_count": 0, "reaction_count": 3, "view_count": 427, "id": "pst_4996a59e0e254878924940540adcc79b", "share_url": "https://afterhour.com/seven33/bxbH/profitable-trading-was-never-a", "link_urls": ""}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "created_at": "2026-10-04T19:31:21.866Z", "tag": "Dd", "gain_loss": "", "amount_k": 0.0, "tickers": "", "title": "One thing I know for sure is\u2026\n\nIf you give trading your everything it will give you more.\n\nThe price you pay is never giving up until that day comes.", 